                "uuid": "7a595c34-ee4b-52d9-925b-904867720c50",
                "value": "STORMVEIL",
                "description": "STORMVEIL (aliases VeilCrew, TA-STORM) is a financially motivated ransomware affiliate group that primarily targets regional hospitals and healthcare providers in North America and Europe. Intrusions begin with phishing e-mails carrying ISO or LNK attachments that deploy the GLASSLOADER loader, followed by hands-on-keyboard activity and deployment of EMBERDROP ransomware roughly five days after initial access.",
