        "EventReport": [
          {
            "name": "Exploitation details",
            "content": "COPPER HERON exploits CVE-2099-12345, a pre-authentication remote code execution flaw in the NetGate X VPN gateway management interface. After exploitation the actor drops healthcheck.jsp (HERONSHELL) and installs the LANTERNBOOT backdoor, which communicates with cdn-metrics.example.com. Exploitation traffic originates from 192.0.2.44. Patch NetGate X to the fixed firmware, restrict the management interface to a management network, and hunt for healthcheck.jsp."
          }
        ]
